---
import DemoFrame from './DemoFrame.astro';
import GoConcSelectLifecycleDemo from '../demos/GoConcSelectLifecycleDemo.tsx';
---
<figure class="gcsl-figure">
  <DemoFrame title="Interactive code & execution trace: context leaks, nil channels, and deadlocks" titleVi="Mô phỏng code & luồng chạy: hủy context sớm, nil channel và deadlock">
    <GoConcSelectLifecycleDemo client:visible />
  </DemoFrame>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Pick a scenario and toggle between the unsafe and Go-safe implementation to watch the highlighted Go code drive the live runtime flow.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Chọn từng kịch bản và chuyển đổi giữa cách viết dễ lỗi với mẫu chuẩn Go để xem từng dòng code điều khiển luồng chạy thực tế.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style is:global>
  .gcsl-figure { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .gcsl-figure > .demo-frame { margin-bottom: 0; }
  .gcsl-figure > figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
  .gcsl .sd-stats { grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(160px, 1fr)); }
  .gcsl .sd-group > span { text-transform: none; letter-spacing: 0; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--text-muted); }
  .gcsl .sd-stat span { text-transform: none; letter-spacing: 0; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; }
  .gcsl .sd-stat b { font-size: 16px; overflow-wrap: anywhere; word-break: break-word; }

  .gcsl-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 1.15fr); gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; }
  @media (max-width: 760px) { .gcsl-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }

  .gcsl-code-card, .gcsl-flow-card {
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 8px;
    background: var(--bg);
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .gcsl-pane-hdr {
    padding: 7px 12px;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    background: var(--bg-alt);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .gcsl-code-body {
    padding: 8px 0;
    overflow-x: auto;
    font-family: var(--font-mono, ui-monospace, monospace);
    font-size: 12px;
    line-height: 1.55;
  }
  .gcsl-line {
    display: flex;
    gap: 8px;
    padding: 2px 12px;
    white-space: pre;
    color: var(--text-body);
    transition: background-color 0.2s ease, color 0.2s ease;
  }
  .gcsl-ln { color: var(--text-muted); user-select: none; min-width: 18px; }
  .gcsl-line.is-active { background: var(--gold-tint-bg); color: var(--text); font-weight: 700; }
  .gcsl-line.is-active.is-bad { background: var(--red-tint-bg); color: var(--red); }
  .gcsl-line.is-active.is-ok { background: rgba(21, 128, 61, 0.14); color: rgb(21, 128, 61); }
  html[data-theme='dark'] .gcsl-line.is-active.is-ok { background: rgba(74, 222, 128, 0.15); color: rgb(74, 222, 128); }

  .gcsl-flow-svg { display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; padding: 8px; }
  .gcsl-flow-svg text { font-size: 11.5px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .gcsl-node { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.4; transition: stroke 0.2s ease, fill 0.2s ease; }
  .gcsl-node.is-active { stroke: var(--gold); fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .gcsl-node.is-bad { stroke: var(--red); fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .gcsl-node.is-ok { stroke: rgb(21, 128, 61); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  html[data-theme='dark'] .gcsl-node.is-ok { stroke: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  .gcsl-nb { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .gcsl-ns { font-size: 10.5px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .gcsl-wire { fill: none; stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 2; }
  .gcsl-wire.is-red { stroke: var(--red); stroke-dasharray: 4 3; }
  .gcsl-wire.is-ok { stroke: rgb(21, 128, 61); }
  html[data-theme='dark'] .gcsl-wire.is-ok { stroke: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  .gcsl-pulse-gold { fill: var(--gold-icon); }
  .gcsl-pulse-red { fill: var(--red); }
  .gcsl-pulse-ok { fill: rgb(21, 128, 61); }
  html[data-theme='dark'] .gcsl-pulse-ok { fill: rgb(74, 222, 128); }

  .gcsl-list { margin: 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; }
  .gcsl-item { display: flex; gap: 10px; padding: 9px 12px; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-left: 3px solid var(--border); border-radius: 7px; background: var(--bg-alt); font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.45; }
  .gcsl-item.is-warn { border-left-color: var(--gold); }
  .gcsl-item.is-ok { border-left-color: rgb(21, 128, 61); }
  html[data-theme='dark'] .gcsl-item.is-ok { border-left-color: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  .gcsl-item.is-bad { border-left-color: var(--red); background: var(--red-tint-bg); color: var(--red); font-weight: 600; }
  .gcsl-step { font-weight: 800; color: var(--text-muted); min-width: 24px; }
  .gcsl-msg { color: var(--text-body); overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
  .gcsl-item.is-bad .gcsl-msg { color: var(--red); }
</style>
